		<item>
		<title>Second updated WWE SmackDown Preview: Jacy Jayne vs. Charlotte Flair, Tag Team Title Match added to tonight&#8217;s show</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/top-story/397335-wwe-smackdown-preview-11-13-26/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/top-story/397335-wwe-smackdown-preview-11-13-26/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 13:53:11 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Top Story]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[11/13/26 WWE SmackDown Preview]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[John Cena]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Smackdown]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397335</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>-Updated @ 6:14 pm ET- WWE has added the MFT (Tama Tonga and Talla Tonga) defending the WWE&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/top-story/397335-wwe-smackdown-preview-11-13-26/">Second updated WWE SmackDown Preview: Jacy Jayne vs. Charlotte Flair, Tag Team Title Match added to tonight&#8217;s show</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Updated @ 6:14 pm ET-</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">WWE has added the MFT (Tama Tonga and Talla Tonga) defending the WWE Tag Team Titles against Bakusai (Shinsuke Nakamura and Kyoki) and Jacy Jayne vs. Charlotte Flair to tonight&#8217;s show.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">****</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Updated @ 3:05 pm ET-</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">WWE has added Finn Balor vs. Gunther to tonight&#8217;s SmackDown lineup.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">****</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Original Preview posted 11/13 @ 8:53 am ET-</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">WWE SmackDown airs live tonight on the USA Network in the US and Netflix internationally, emanating from the Amerant Bank Arena in Sunrise, Florida.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="596" height="335" src="https://www.wrestleview.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/images-1.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-397337" style="width:464px;height:auto" srcset="https://www.wrestleview.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/images-1.jpg 596w, https://www.wrestleview.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/images-1-379x213.jpg 379w, https://www.wrestleview.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/images-1-550x309.jpg 550w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 596px) 100vw, 596px" /></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At the time of this writing, WWE is advertising tonight&#8217;s show which is the fallout from Crown Jewel, appearances by John Cena and new WWE Women&#8217;s Champion Tiffany Stratton.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">*Live coverage of tonight&#8217;s WWE SmackDown begins at 8:00 pm ET*</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/top-story/397335-wwe-smackdown-preview-11-13-26/">Second updated WWE SmackDown Preview: Jacy Jayne vs. Charlotte Flair, Tag Team Title Match added to tonight&#8217;s show</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
